Implement a 16-bit multiplier that performs multiplication of the input value by 16. The module takes a 16-bit input, generates multiple left-shifted versions of this input to represent successive multiplication by powers of two, and sums all shifted values to produce the final output. This design effectively computes the product by leveraging bitwise shifts and addition.
